        "t": "text",
        "v": "The reason is freshness. An index is a snapshot. If the orders table is embedded nightly, the bot tells a customer their package is \"processing\" twelve hours after it shipped. A tool call hits the system of record at the moment of the question. The rule is simple: prefer retrieval for content that changes, tools for state that changes, and neither when the content is small and stable enough to sit in the prompt. [1]"
