        "v": "Managed Agents is built on four concepts: an agent (model, prompt, tools, MCP servers, skills), an environment (cloud or self-hosted sandbox), a session (a running instance doing a task), and events (messages between your app and the agent). It fits work that needs long execution, stateful sessions with a persistent filesystem, and scheduled execution on a cron schedule through scheduled deployments. [7]"
