        "t": "text",
        "v": "The Batches API accepts up to 100,000 requests or 256 MB per batch. Requests still unprocessed after 24 hours expire unbilled; results stay downloadable for 29 days. Named use cases are large-scale evaluations, content moderation, data analysis, and bulk content generation. [8]"
