        "v": "A market-intelligence team wants a system that answers questions like \"which of our twelve competitors changed pricing in the last quarter, and what did they change.\" Sources are press releases, filings, review sites, and an internal CRM. Answers must carry citations. The team currently runs one agent with 26 tools and reports that it misses competitors and picks the wrong tool."
